  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "[\"Selected specimen is nearly complete but partly repaired and compressed. This is an interpretation of its documented museum fossil form, not an unaltered specimen facsimile or living-shell restoration.\", \"Published repair is identified by local whorl-height interval18–27mm, not an exact angular coordinate; do not assert an exact repair mask not supported by source. Use a subdued bridge rather than fabricated diagnostic detail.\", \"Thumbnail edge photos do not permit precise thickness reconstruction;55mm working maximum may vary15–20%.\", \"Stage is Lower Aptian, broad Cretaceous original retained; avoid old unsupported worldwide distributions or Barremian age assignments for this species.\"] {\"unit\": \"metre\", \"total_height\": 0.33, \"coil_major_diameter\": 0.147, \"coil_minor_diameter\": 0.107, \"whorl_height_end_phragmocone\": 0.069, \"maximum_measured_whorl_height\": 0.071, \"early_measured_whorl_height\": 0.014, \"working_overall_width\": 0.185, \"working_max_axial_thickness\": 0.055, \"basis\": \"All first six dimensions from table p4, Fig2 also has50mm scale bar. Width185mm and axial55mm estimated from same-specimen photos, approximately15–20% uncertainty. Published h values are whorl height, NOT shell wall thickness.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Dimensions describe flattened fossil, not undeformed animal. No reverse-deformation or pristine aperture restoration.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：[\"Selected specimen is nearly complete but partly repaired and compressed. This is an interpretation of its documented museum fossil form, not an unaltered specimen facsimile or living-shell restoration.\", \"Published repair is identified by local whorl-height interval18–27mm, not an exact angular coordinate; do not assert an exact repair mask not supported by source. Use a subdued bridge rather than fabricated diagnostic detail.\", \"Thumbnail edge photos do not permit precise thickness reconstruction;55mm working maximum may vary15–20%.\", \"Stage is Lower Aptian, broad Cretaceous original retained; avoid old unsupported worldwide distributions or Barremian age assignments for this species.\"] {\"unit\": \"metre\", \"total_height\": 0.33, \"coil_major_diameter\": 0.147, \"coil_minor_diameter\": 0.107, \"whorl_height_end_phragmocone\": 0.069, \"maximum_measured_whorl_height\": 0.071, \"early_measured_whorl_height\": 0.014, \"working_overall_width\": 0.185, \"working_max_axial_thickness\": 0.055, \"basis\": \"All first six dimensions from table p4, Fig2 also has50mm scale bar. Width185mm and axial55mm estimated from same-specimen photos, approximately15–20% uncertainty. Published h values are whorl height, NOT shell wall thickness.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Dimensions describe flattened fossil, not undeformed animal. No reverse-deformation or pristine aperture restoration.\"}"
  },
